Colour palettes

The Control Deck's built-in themes (crates/web/assets/look.js) include these
palettes. Only the colour values are used. The deck colours shown beside each
(bars, buttons, lines) are spandeck's own choice from the same palette, and
the terminal's contrast floor set with the two Solarized themes is spandeck's.

